{"id":4936,"date":"2025-07-31T17:20:47","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T17:20:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4936"},"modified":"2025-08-28T09:23:38","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T02:23:38","slug":"cach-sao-chep-lien-ket-tiktok","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/cach-sao-chep-lien-ket-tiktok\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"B773dQhuUoM4ilxsAkylQXERgte\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RA9vdZ5T4onDERxOnjjlKs35gcg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n g\u1eedi link video TikTok cho b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 hay chia s\u1ebb l\u00ean m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i? Ch\u1ec9 v\u1edbi v\u00e0i thao t\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n: nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng chia s\u1ebb (m\u0169i t\u00ean cong) &gt; ch\u1ecdn \u201cSao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft\u201d, l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n \u0111\u00e3 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00e1n link \u1edf b\u1ea5t c\u1ee9 \u0111\u00e2u m\u00ecnh mu\u1ed1n. D\u00f9 \u0111\u1ec3 lan t\u1ecfa n\u1ed9i dung, l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i video y\u00eau th\u00edch hay qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, thao t\u00e1c n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec1u c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 h\u1eefu \u00edch. C\u00f9ng<span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong><a style=\"color: #ffcc00;\" href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"> Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/span> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 chi ti\u1ebft c\u00e1ch sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok qua c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CSQVdqiuhoaQ5Hx2E1nlBL6sgxc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KGILddZIeoMYvGxsb50lU8HNghh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft Tiktok \u0111\u1ec3 l\u00e0m g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4941\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4941\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4941\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-7.png\" alt=\"Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ec3 chia s\u1ebb video y\u00eau th\u00edch\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-7.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-7-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-7-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-7-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/1-7-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4941\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ec3 chia s\u1ebb video y\u00eau th\u00edch<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OKd9d7tVQoqcY4xM4WAlZRGQg4f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok l\u00e0 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng l\u1ea5y URL (\u0111\u01b0\u1eddng d\u1eabn) c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t video, h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, b\u00e0i h\u00e1t ho\u1eb7c hashtag tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok nh\u1eb1m chia s\u1ebb ho\u1eb7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0o nhi\u1ec1u m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch kh\u00e1c nhau. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng l\u1ea1i r\u1ea5t h\u1eefu \u00edch. Ngo\u00e0i ra, v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi l\u00e0m marketing, influencer ho\u1eb7c seller tr\u00ean TikTok Shop, li\u00ean k\u1ebft video ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ec3 g\u1eafn v\u00e0o bio, ch\u1ea1y qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o, \u0111\u1eb7t trong website ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung email marketing. Trong affiliate marketing, li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok gi\u00fap \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ea7n qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 mua h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn hoa h\u1ed3ng. T\u00f3m l\u1ea1i, sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc quan tr\u1ecdng trong vi\u1ec7c lan t\u1ecfa n\u1ed9i dung, thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VFJsdBPeAoJDTRxuBwole6Ygg3g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Ewjtd430vo01WzxkVwVleoxjgLf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2.<\/strong> <strong> L\u1ee3i \u00edch khi sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft video TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LIo6dkiRTowZuUxq6Nyl0BIsgcc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft video TikTok mang l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch thi\u1ebft th\u1ef1c, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t trong vi\u1ec7c chia s\u1ebb, lan t\u1ecfa n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng ki\u1ebfm ti\u1ec1n. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc h\u1ebft, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 g\u1eedi video nhanh ch\u00f3ng cho b\u1ea1n b\u00e8 ho\u1eb7c c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng qua c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c nh\u01b0 Messenger, Zalo, Facebook, Instagram hay email. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap video ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi h\u01a1n ngo\u00e0i ph\u1ea1m vi TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IBR7dnVqooD4jAxLuiflpuPQgVd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1ee9 hai, v\u1edbi nh\u1eefng ai l\u00e0m affiliate ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, vi\u1ec7c g\u1eafn link video v\u00e0o bio, trang web, ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o gi\u00fap \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u01b0\u1edbng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ebfn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng. Ngo\u00e0i ra, sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft c\u0169ng l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 l\u01b0u l\u1ea1i n\u1ed9i dung y\u00eau th\u00edch, ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u trend, h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi c\u00e1ch l\u00e0m video hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ho\u1eb7c l\u00ean \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o. T\u00f3m l\u1ea1i, vi\u1ec7c sao ch\u00e9p link video TikTok l\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c nh\u1ecf nh\u01b0ng mang l\u1ea1i l\u1ee3i \u00edch l\u1edbn v\u1ec1 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn, chia s\u1ebb, l\u01b0u tr\u1eef v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 kinh doanh online.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CQLTdGFVao7U23xyiSulWUlSgXg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SrV6dBY6roIviqxZMnKl3vChgVb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1ch sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng, nhanh ch\u00f3ng<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Eji5dRbqFoyAivxsGi5lFFWKgbf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok r\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 m\u1ea5t v\u00e0i gi\u00e2y thao t\u00e1c. Gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng chia s\u1ebb video y\u00eau th\u00edch \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n b\u00e8, g\u1eedi link cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u0103ng l\u1ea1i tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GQGodcl7eoYbcAxubodlfOuDgIf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.1. <strong>Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft video TikTok<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UOuUdKwOhouNAzx2YoHlWHySgub\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> M\u1edf video b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n chia s\u1ebb tr\u00ean \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Be6pdZu4EoIgMgx3pvPlM4aRgLc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng <strong>m\u0169i t\u00ean chia s\u1ebb<\/strong> (n\u1eb1m b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i m\u00e0n h\u00ecnh, d\u01b0\u1edbi bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T9M7dohQfoYCd2x6vSblQseZgag\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3:<\/strong> Trong danh s\u00e1ch t\u00f9y ch\u1ecdn hi\u1ec7n ra, ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c <strong>\u201cSao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft\u201d (Copy link)<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OEOydtX8ZoeGjBxRbGQlvutlgLb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4:<\/strong> Li\u00ean k\u1ebft s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0u v\u00e0o b\u1ed9 nh\u1edb t\u1ea1m, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 <strong>d\u00e1n (paste)<\/strong> v\u00e0o tin nh\u1eafn, b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft ho\u1eb7c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c ngay l\u1eadp t\u1ee9c.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4937\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4937\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4937\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-5-2.png\" alt=\"h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft video TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-5-2.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-5-2-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-5-2-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-5-2-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-5-2-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4937\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">H\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft video TikTok \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n v\u00e0 nhanh ch\u00f3ng<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"B773dQhuUoM4ilxsAkylQXERgte\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JJ7tdjdedoyF6oxJr3llIvEXg7c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-QdWUdbvqSoitb6xDy6Nlt9Zegqc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3.2. <strong>Sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft trang c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n TikTok<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VIGkd0wvsowPTgxllWYl5Ab6gnh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1:<\/strong> Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 TikTok c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ho\u1eb7c ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ixl0dodJOoS6xIxpbtDlyEYZgDc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2:<\/strong> Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng <strong>ba d\u1ea5u ch\u1ea5m<\/strong> (\u2022\u2022\u2022) ho\u1eb7c n\u00fat chia s\u1ebb tr\u00ean g\u00f3c ph\u1ea3i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ahkvdv1fBoha0Ex3Y00l7Zs4g0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3:<\/strong> Ch\u1ecdn <strong>\u201cSao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft\u201d<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea5y URL trang c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nn3edqAwwo5Amwx7WavlcF0mg6f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-X2JjdJ2oOofwHix5iEtlEemfghg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>4. L\u01b0u \u00fd khi sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4939\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4939\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4939\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-7.png\" alt=\"Tr\u00e1nh th\u00eam k\u00fd t\u1ef1 ho\u1eb7c r\u00fat g\u1ecdn sai \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng, v\u00ec \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m h\u1ecfng link v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-7.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-7-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-7-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-7-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/2-7-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4939\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Tr\u00e1nh th\u00eam k\u00fd t\u1ef1 ho\u1eb7c r\u00fat g\u1ecdn sai \u0111\u1ecbnh d\u1ea1ng, v\u00ec \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 l\u00e0m h\u1ecfng link v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WHlPdueZconaftxYz97lFtsjgB6\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u00f9 sao ch\u00e9p li\u00ean k\u1ebft TikTok l\u00e0 thao t\u00e1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n v\u1eabn c\u1ea7n ghi nh\u1edb m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh r\u1eafc r\u1ed1i:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QhyFda6mpo8OwIxL4OuljgXVgPc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o video \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 c\u00f4ng khai<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu video b\u1ecb \u0111\u1eb7t \u1edf ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 ri\u00eang t\u01b0 ho\u1eb7c b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n quy\u1ec1n xem, ng\u01b0\u1eddi nh\u1eadn li\u00ean k\u1ebft s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 truy c\u1eadp \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8JHdmOZnout9WxMmpSly4I5gBf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kh\u00f4ng chia s\u1ebb n\u1ed9i dung vi ph\u1ea1m<\/strong>: Tr\u00e1nh sao ch\u00e9p v\u00e0 lan truy\u1ec1n video ch\u1ee9a th\u00f4ng tin sai l\u1ec7ch, ph\u1ea3n c\u1ea3m ho\u1eb7c vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n \u2014 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u1ea1n.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UW3NdlAk9o0RzzxqHp5lFp5lgfX\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ki\u1ec3m tra t\u00ednh ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c c\u1ee7a link<\/strong>: Tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi g\u1eedi cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c d\u00e1n v\u00e0o bio, h\u00e3y th\u1eed m\u1edf l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ch\u1eafc ch\u1eafn li\u00ean k\u1ebft ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u00fang.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XiUDdAoDioN5EuxG18FlqPWqgdh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kh\u00f4ng d\u00f9ng link gi\u1ea3 m\u1ea1o<\/strong>: N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0m ti\u1ebfp th\u1ecb li\u00ean k\u1ebft, n\u00ean ki\u1ec3m tra v\u00e0 x\u00e1c minh r\u00f5 link g\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh g\u00e2y hi\u1ec3u l\u1ea7m, spam ho\u1eb7c vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T7BBdwGFaovfsZxTkx3lMgBYgle\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng quy\u1ec1n ri\u00eang t\u01b0<\/strong>: Kh\u00f4ng chia s\u1ebb link d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ebfn video c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c th\u00f4ng tin nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi kh\u00e1c khi ch\u01b0a c\u00f3 s\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed3ng \u00fd.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XwnddiijFoBftIxJ4QLl5AgYgJD\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng li\u00ean k\u1ebft \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n lan t\u1ecfa n\u1ed9i dung an to\u00e0n, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n, nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 trong c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ho\u1eb7c x\u00e2y k\u00eanh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OHazd7sQloYHlrxmCD8lLxskgne\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>B\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n g\u1eedi link video 